  "description": "Connects the OASIS to SQLite -- the world's most widely deployed embedded relational database. Stores OASIS holons and avatar data in a local SQLite file with zero configuration and no server required. Ideal for desktop apps, mobile, edge/IoT, or offline-first OASIS deployments. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
